{
  "id": "MAT.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 19",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okwegeria igoro y’ogotigana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 10:1-12; Luk 16:18)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yeso achia gokoora gokwana amang’ana ayio, akarua Galili, agasoa ensemo ya Boyahudi ng’umbu ya Yorodani;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na emeganda emenene ekamotunyana, akabagwenia aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafarisai bakamochiera, bakamoteema ase okomoboria, “Inee! Mboronge omonto atige mok’aye ase ring’ana rinde rionsi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabairaneria, “Timwana gosoma buna ere oyobatongete korwa omochakano, nere obatongete omosacha na omokungu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agateeba: Ase engencho eyio omonto natige ise na ng’ina, abwatane na mok’aye, na abwo babere nigo barabe omobere oyomo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo tibakoba babere naende, korende omobere oyomo. Naboigo, ebi Nyasae abwatanirie, Mwanyabaanto tabiatanana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamobooria, “Nase ki rende Musa achiigete komoa omokungu riruube ri’ogotigana, na komotiga?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Nase engencho y’obokong’u bwe chinkoro chiaino Musa abaete ribaga gotiga abakungu baino, korende ayio tarenge bo korwa omochakano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inche nabateebirie, oyoratige mok’aye, otatiga ase engencho y’obotomani, na konyuoma oyonde, oyio otomanire; naende oy’oranyuome omokungu oyotigirwe, otomanire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aborokigwa bakamoteebia, “Amang’ana igoro y’omonto na mok’aye k’arabe engencho eye, tegwenereti konywoma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende akabateebia, “Tari bonsi baranyare gwancha ring’ana eri, otatiga abwo baeirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inaki mbare abagomba abaiboretwe bo, naende mbare abagomba aba abanto bagombaetie, naende mbare abagomba abekorete abanyene koba abagomba ase engencho y’oborwoti bwa igoro. Oyoranyare gwancha ring’ana eri, tiga arianche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso ogosesenia abana abake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 10:13-16; Luk 18:15-17)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abana abake bakarentwa ase Yeso, erinde ababeekere amaboko aye na kobasabera. Aborokigwa baye bagatanga abanto,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende Yeso agateeba, “Batige abana bache ase ’nde, timobaisa kobatanga, ekiagera abare buna aba, oborwoti bwa igoro n’obwabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akababeekera amaboko aye, akaimoka korwa aroro, akagenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omomura omonda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 10:17-22; Luk 18:18-23)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rora, omonto oyomo akamochiera, akamobooria, “Omworokia ’mboseera ki ndakore ’nyore obogima bwa kare na kare?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamoteebia, “Nase ki okomboria ninki kere ekiya? Nareo oyomo bweka oyore omuya. Onye korigetie gosoa ase obogima, bwata amachiiko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamoboria, “Ayare buna arari?” Yeso akamoiraneria, “Toita, Totomana, Toiba, Toteba oborimo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sika iso na nyoko; naende: Ancha omogisangio oo buna bweanchete",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omomura oria akamoteebia, “Ayio onsi nayabwatire; ing’ana ki rimochete?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akamoteebia, “Onye korigetie koba omoikeranu, gachie, oonie ebio ore nabio bionsi, oe abataka, na aye n’obe neniibo igoro; erio oche ontunyane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero achia koigwa ring’ana riria, omomura oria akagenda nobororo, ekiagera arenge neniibo enyinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso agateebia aborokigwa baye, “Nekeene nabateebirie: Nabe aakong’u ase omonto omonda gosoa ase oborwoti bwa igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende nabateebirie inwe, naororo engamia goeta ase ekebao gi’esindani, kobua omonto omonda gosoa ase oborwoti bwa Nyasae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero aborokigwa bachia koigwa aya, bagakumia mono, bagateeba, “Ning’o rende oranyare gotooreka?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yeso akabarigereria, akabateebia, “Aya takonyarekana ase Mwanyabaanto, korende ase Nyasae onsi nigo akonyarekana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Petero akamoiraneria, “Rora, intwe twatigire bionsi, twagotunyanire, inki rende toranyore?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabateebia, “Nekeene nabateebirie: Ase ense enyia, ekero Omwana-o-Mwanyabaanto agochi‐gocha gaikaransete ase ekerogo kiaye ki’obonene, inwe abamwantunyanire inamoche goikaransera ebirogo bi’obonene ikomi na bibere, mokogaambera ebisaku ikomi na bibere bi’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na onde bwensi otigete chinyomba, gose bamura bamwabo, gose basubati bamwabo, gose ise, gose ng’ina, gose abana, gose emegondo ase engencho y’erieta riane, namenteranigwe ara rigana, na obogima bwa kare na kare nabonyore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abange abare ab’eritang’ani inababe abamagega, na abamagega inababe ab’eritang’ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
